>>> or any other tunables?
>
>CFLAGS=-O2 -pipe -g
>CPUTYPE?=ev56
...
>>The only special flag beside compiler flags is the following:
>>WITHOUT_XFT=yes
>
>I'll try that.

mozilla-1.3.1,2 builds and runs on an EV45 AS4100 with the following
/etc/make.conf :

CPUTYPE?=ev56
CFLAGS= -O2 -pipe -g
COPTFLAGS=-O -pipe
WITHOUT_XFT=yes
# -- use.perl generated deltas -- #
# Created: Tue May 25 14:30:04 1915
# Setting to use base perl from ports:
PERL_VER=5.6.1
PERL_VERSION=5.6.1
PERL_ARCH=mach
NOPERL=yo
NO_PERL=yo
NO_PERL_WRAPPER=yo

Thanks to Bernd for his assistance.

Peter
